{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:34 2026-09-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:34 2026-09-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:34 2026-09-01 HKT</p><p>深水埗發生火警。今日（9月1日）早上10時許，元州街15A號一青少年院舍有房間起火冒煙。消防員接報到場灌救，瞬間將火救熄，初步相信是電線短路引起火警。事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p><img alt=\"消防員到場。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a42a441ff5be0e4ff8da9900c7e052d4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_11_19_29.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"發生火警的是青少年院舍。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f54ad695904de31d7b9e189634b1ae15/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_11_19_28_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e00d1532bd396669da84feb0ff07f03a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_11_19_28_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31ce029bd5f4a1210c3b9c9bb4fbe6fb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_11_19_28.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b739409bd389f22edbee587bf318632/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_11_19_29_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T03:40:12.619328+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}